                <solution>Upgrade to PHP version 5.2.8 or later.

                    Note that version 5.2.7 has been removed from distribution because of a regression in that version
                    that results in the &apos;magic_quotes_gpc&apos; setting remaining off even if it was set to on.
                </solution>
