                <description>According to its banner, the version of PHP 5.x installed on the remote host is 5.x prior
                    to 5.3.11 or 5.4.x prior to 5.4.1 and thus, is potentially affected by a security bypass
                    vulnerability.

                    An error exists related to the function &apos;PHP_RSHUTDOWN_FUNCTION&apos; in the libxml extension
                    and the &apos;stream_close&apos; method that could allow a remote attacker to bypass &apos;open_basedir&apos;
