                <synopsis>The remote web server contains a PHP script that is prone to an information disclosure
                    attack.
                </synopsis>
                <plugin_output>
                    Nessus discovered the following URL that calls phpinfo() :

                    - http://testphp.vulnweb.com/secured/phpinfo.php
                </plugin_output>
